[For "white"]
[Kind "sideline"]
[Start "london-main 5.c3"]
[Name "The set-up: Black takes on d4"]

5... cxd4 { Trades in the centre and asks White which pawn to use. }
6. exd4 { The e-pawn takes back. It opens the e-file for a rook and the diagonal for the queen, and the f4 bishop is still outside the chain. [%cal Gf4c7] }
6... Bd6
7. Bg3 { Keeps the bishop, as in every line of this opening. } *
